  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">AJAR Fellowship National Summit: Strengthening Roots, Weaving Solidarity</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This is an additional fund requested to support the applicant&#x2019;s activity called a National Summit. The summit itself was initially registered under a grant agreement INS-2160 23/0001 Empowering Young Indonesian Women and Men to Find Their Voice &amp; Speak Out for Justice.

Expected results: 

6-day summit with at least 53 participants from various places in Indonesia (mainly rural and remote areas). 

15 community showcases and 1 national exhibition presented. 

Inclusive statement from the participants. 

Documentations (photos, reports, media coverage) capturing outcomes and lessons learned.</narrative>
  </description>
